OL,3,GNEWSABridge repairs start after police
OL,4,Acar hit barrier
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepairs have started on a Grade
OL,7,FII-listed bridge several months after a
OL,8,Fpolice car went through it after an
OL,9,Fofficer's laptop became lodged in the
OL,10,Fsteering column.
OL,12,FOne lane has been closed on Worcester
OL,13,FBridge, in Worcester, while damaged
OL,14,Fstonework is repaired using specialist
OL,15,Fconservation techniques.
OL,17,FThe accident took place in March when a
OL,18,FWest Mercia Police driver lost the
OL,19,Fability to steer when a loose laptop
OL,20,Fbecame trapped, resulting in a
OL,21,Flow-speed collision with the bridge
OL,22,Fparapet.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
