OL,3,GNEWSABridge repairs start after police
OL,4,Acar hit barrier
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorcestershire County Council said the
OL,7,Fwork was expected to take up to three
OL,8,Fweeks, with motorists warned to expect
OL,9,Fdelays, particularly at peak times.
OL,10,FPedestrian access will remain
OL,11,Favailable.
